									<v8:content>In access right settings, you are authorized to open files of external reports and data processors
from menu &lt;b&gt;File - &lt;/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open&lt;/&gt;. When opening such files, pay special attention 
to their source, and do not open files 
from unknown sources.  

Otherwise, such files might be harmful to your computer and the application data. 
See also: &lt;link http://1c.ru/news/info.jsp?id=21537&gt;Virus problem example in the external data processor&lt;/&gt;.
</v8:content>
